	id: "603B7ADC4EC528C2"
	order_index: 5
	quest_links: [ ]
	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"&fI have arrived in this strange land of Red Barar, a lively place filled with vampires... oh sorry, Sanguines, as they refer to themselves. Vampires are only artificial sanguines. I've come here in search of this Moon Cult who seem to have knowledge over the Moon Pathway. At least I acquired my Temperance card a while ago."
				""
				"&fIt seems they are having this grand festival around this time of year. Time to blend right in."
				""
				"&aThe quests in this chapter are revealed as the quests before are completed. Most quests in this chapter require items to be submitted."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "0822814E563A5044"
			rewards: [{
				id: "5B4CF561B6FE1579"
				item: "hexerei:blood_bottle"
				type: "item"
			}]
			tasks: [{
				consume_items: true
				id: "62C638C03777884A"
				item: "minecraft:carved_pumpkin"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "The Blood Festival"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0822814E563A5044"]
			description: ["&fIt seems that part of this festival is a competition between sanguines to determine who can harvest the most blood within 3 weeks. I would be led to believe this would be terribly skewed towards the aristocrats with a dozen of factories producing blood day and night and turns out I would be correct. There's a kid's category for manual blood collection."]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "63785492CE884D72"
			rewards: [{
				count: 13
				id: "3B294FAC22F44080"
				item: "minecraft:gold_ingot"
				type: "item"
			}]
			size: 1.15d
			tasks: [{
				consume_items: true
				id: "720829EB32FB31D7"
				item: "hexerei:blood_bottle"
				match_nbt: true
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "The Competition"
			x: 0.0d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["63785492CE884D72"]
			description: [
				"&fSometimes I forget these sanguines have to drink blood all of the time. I have a diet consisting of my own blood quite some time ago as I obtained my Temperance card. Not a pleasant experience, but I was completely broke."
				""
				"&fSeems like the proceeds of this festival are going to charity... are there poor sanguines? I thought everyone was rich around here. If not, why don't they just step into the sun? Their human livestock surely don't need the blood."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "0702805376964E53"
			rewards: [{
				count: 9
				id: "69555A41FF67667C"
				item: "minecraft:diamond"
				type: "item"
			}]
			tasks: [{
				consume_items: true
				count: 10L
				id: "67C27B705ED5D36A"
				item: "hexerei:blood_bottle"
				match_nbt: true
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 0.0d
			y: -3.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0702805376964E53"]
			description: [
				"&fIn frustration, I have learned that the blood I've been donating does not actually enter into my collection count yet for the festival. In fact, this is only a twisted entrance fee, or rather a proof that one can compete."
				""
				"&fSo, I'm just giving blood and not receiving any vouchers! What a scam! Well, there's only about half a hundred left to produce before I can truly compete among the sanguines."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "1BE7F4AA8E307379"
			rewards: [{
				id: "2063F9B6A41D7EE5"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "the_deep_void:dark_steel_pickaxe"
					tag: {
						Damage: 0
					}
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			tasks: [{
				consume_items: true
				count: 20L
				id: "633D28CD61111571"
				item: "hexerei:blood_bottle"
				match_nbt: true
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 0.0d
			y: -5.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1BE7F4AA8E307379"]
			description: ["&fAt least, I receive some smaller participation prizes from some of the items donated to the festival. I got a handy ferrum pickaxe... I don't think it holds up to my archmage's spellbook. What looks to be more enticing is an antique living blood sword. It's not the most powerful of weapons, but it is elegant."]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "0E94DB0377908CD4"
			rewards: [{
				id: "612A2B70BF931106"
				item: {
					Count: 1
					id: "concatenationcore:bloody_living_giant_sword"
					tag: {
						Damage: 0
					}
				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			tasks: [{
				consume_items: true
				count: 50L
				id: "636A460D8CF9B7C4"
				item: "hexerei:blood_bottle"
				match_nbt: true
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 0.0d
			y: -6.5d
		}
		{
			can_repeat: true
			dependencies: ["0E94DB0377908CD4"]
			description: [
				"&fFinally, I've entered the first true stage of the festival! From now on, every 5 blood bottle I donate, I get a voucher! At least, this is going to a good cause, right?"
				""
				"&fI've found it strange the Sanguines are not bothered with my entry. I might be the only human equal in power around here."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "4B7758AE76C7CB09"
			rewards: [{
				id: "2BEE655A3FE42747"
				item: "concatenationcore:blood_festival_fragment"
				type: "item"
			}]
			shape: "gear"
			tasks: [{
				consume_items: true
				count: 3L
				id: "09847FC80E17D858"
				item: "hexerei:blood_bottle"
				match_nbt: true
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 0.0d
			y: -8.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4B7758AE76C7CB09"]
			description: ["I can finally start earning fragments... the one who has the most fragments wins the competition. However, they can also be redeemed for various rewards. But if I spend them, I won't be able to win. Was this rigged?"]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			hide_dependent_lines: true
			id: "6378F35C4C516CC5"
			rewards: [{
				id: "2C57BDF69EEEB2DA"
				item: "concatenationcore:karma_tome"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "The Collection"
			tasks: [{
