		{
			dependencies: ["0822814E563A5044"]
			description: [
				"&o&7Ethereal pages slip through the chapter."
				""
				"&cWell, Grisha, guess what! I am not alone in the world!"
				""
				"&4My congratulations, young Sanguine."
				""
				"&cUnfortunately, I found an old man who doesn't have much left for this world. While Sanguine society has collapsed, this has reminded me that this is the season of the Blood Festival. The old man said he had a tradition of making and lighting a red lantern every year, but he's now too weak to produce the materials. I will take it upon myself to fulfill his last request."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "5D8625CDFFDE31EB"
			rewards: [{
				id: "2AA4AEA6D71F12B5"
