		{
			dependencies: ["1AAB788A86287E44"]
			description: [
				"&o&7Notes from Eleonore's Travels, Tome VII"
				""
				"&fI noticed a ship's captain looking to buy wither skulls at the market. Now, those are rare and dangerous items, obviously no one has them. I asked him why he was ready to pay such a high price for only one skull. He said that he had inherited a wither skull from his previous captain. This skull was kept on his desk for the longest of times and he had grown sentimental. "
				""
				"&fHowever, the skull was stolen in a raid and he's looking for a replacement. Now, I'm not sure about the sentimental value considering it clearly won't be the same skull, but with how rare they are, he might just end up finding the right one. Let's see if I can help him..."
